    "Next unreleased: the first release in the Jira project that is not yet released, whatever it is called. A template builds the name, and the release is created if Jira does not have it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一个未发布版本：Jira 项目中第一个尚未发布的版本，不论名称。模板用于生成名称，若 Jira 中不存在则创建该版本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一個未發佈版本：Jira 專案中第一個尚未發佈的版本，不論名稱。範本用於產生名稱，若 Jira 中不存在則建立該版本。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अगला अप्रकाशित: Jira प्रोजेक्ट का पहला अप्रकाशित रिलीज़, नाम कोई भी हो। टेम्पलेट नाम बनाता है; Jira में न होने पर रिलीज़ बनाई जाती है।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siguiente sin publicar: la primera versión no publicada del proyecto Jira, sin importar su nombre. La plantilla genera el nombre y crea la versión si no existe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prochaine non publiée : première version non publiée du projet Jira, quel que soit son nom. Un modèle génère le nom et la version est créée si elle n’existe pas."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "পরবর্তী অপ্রকাশিত: Jira প্রকল্পের প্রথম অপ্রকাশিত রিলিজ, নাম যাই হোক। টেমপ্লেট নাম তৈরি করে এবং Jira-তে না থাকলে রিলিজ তৈরি হয়।"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Próxima não lançada: primeira versão não lançada do projeto Jira, qualquer que seja o nome. O modelo gera o nome e cria a versão se não existir."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Следующая невыпущенная: первый невыпущенный релиз проекта Jira независимо от имени. Шаблон создаёт имя; если версии нет в Jira, она создаётся."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次の未リリース：名前に関係なく、Jiraプロジェクトの最初の未リリースバージョンです。テンプレートは名前を生成し、Jiraにない場合はリリースを作成します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "다음 미출시 버전은 이름과 관계없이 Jira 프로젝트의 첫 미출시 릴리스입니다. 템플릿은 이름을 생성하며 Jira에 없으면 릴리스를 만듭니다."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nästa outgivna: första outgivna versionen i Jira-projektet, oavsett namn. En mall skapar namnet och versionen skapas om den inte finns i Jira."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prossima non rilasciata: prima versione non rilasciata del progetto Jira, qualunque sia il nome. Il modello genera il nome e crea la versione se non esiste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dates: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, unpadded {y} {m} {d} {w}, offsets like {year-2000}; also {prNumber} and any {{variable}} below. {year}.{isoWeek} is 2026.39 in week 39.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日期：{year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}；不补零：{y} {m} {d} {w}；偏移如 {year-2000}。也支持 {prNumber} 和下方的 {{variable}}。第 39 周的 {year}.{isoWeek} 为 2026.39。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日期：{year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}；不補零：{y} {m} {d} {w}；位移如 {year-2000}。也支援 {prNumber} 和下方的 {{variable}}。第 39 週的 {year}.{isoWeek} 為 2026.39。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "तिथियाँ: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, बिना शून्य {y} {m} {d} {w}, अंतर जैसे {year-2000}; साथ में {prNumber} और नीचे कोई {{variable}}। सप्ताह 39 में {year}.{isoWeek} का मान 2026.39 है।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fechas: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, sin ceros {y} {m} {d} {w}, desplazamientos como {year-2000}; también {prNumber} y cualquier {{variable}} inferior. {year}.{isoWeek} es 2026.39 en la semana 39."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dates : {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, sans zéros {y} {m} {d} {w}, décalages comme {year-2000} ; aussi {prNumber} et toute {{variable}} ci-dessous. {year}.{isoWeek} donne 2026.39 en semaine 39."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "তারিখ: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, শূন্য ছাড়া {y} {m} {d} {w}, ব্যবধান যেমন {year-2000}; এছাড়া {prNumber} ও নিচের যেকোনো {{variable}}। ৩৯তম সপ্তাহে {year}.{isoWeek} হলো 2026.39।"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Datas: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, sem zeros {y} {m} {d} {w}, deslocamentos como {year-2000}; também {prNumber} e qualquer {{variable}} abaixo. {year}.{isoWeek} é 2026.39 na semana 39."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Даты: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, без ведущих нулей {y} {m} {d} {w}, смещения вида {year-2000}; также {prNumber} и любая {{variable}} ниже. {year}.{isoWeek} даёт 2026.39 на 39-й неделе."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日付：{year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}、ゼロ埋めなし：{y} {m} {d} {w}、差分：{year-2000}など。{prNumber}と下記の{{variable}}も使えます。第39週の{year}.{isoWeek}は2026.39です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "날짜: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, 0 채움 없음: {y} {m} {d} {w}, 오프셋: {year-2000} 등. {prNumber}와 아래 {{variable}}도 사용할 수 있습니다. 39주차의 {year}.{isoWeek}는 2026.39입니다."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Datum: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, utan nollutfyllnad {y} {m} {d} {w}, förskjutningar som {year-2000}; även {prNumber} och valfri {{variable}} nedan. {year}.{isoWeek} blir 2026.39 i vecka 39."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Date: {year} {month} {day} {isoWeek}, senza zeri {y} {m} {d} {w}, scostamenti come {year-2000}; anche {prNumber} e ogni {{variable}} sotto. {year}.{isoWeek} è 2026.39 nella settimana 39."
          }
        }
      }
    },
